# Prettier's mdx parser rewrites markdown emphasis (`*x*` -> `_x_`) across the whole file,
# including inside `{/* ... */}` JSX comments — it turns them into `{/_ ... _/}`, which acorn
# then cannot parse, and the Storybook build fails to index the page. Format MDX by hand.
*.mdx
